                <pb facs="0706" n="694" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg694"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 PW/8–2645: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-26T13:00:00-04:00">August 26, 1945—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1916. Your 3061, August 25, midnight. You are authorized to confirm the fact that
                    General Order No. 1 has been amended to provide for surrender of Japanese forces
                    in the Kuriles to be accepted by the Soviet Command.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
